== Walkthrough ==

You say, 'Hail, Gozzrem'

: Gozzrem says 'Greetings Ayama . If you seek wisdom or the arcane I have tasks in the halls of testing you may complete to gain what you seek. 

You say, 'I seek wisdom'

: Gozzrem says 'Wisdom can be gleaned from battle and that is what I wish you to do. Battle in the halls of testing may give you a different outlook on life. Which do you seek, the short battle or the long battle ? 

You say, 'I seek the long battle'

: Gozzrem says 'You will spend much time in the halls of testing. Seek out a [[Runed Tear]] ([[Dozekar the Cursed]]) and a [[Flame Kissed Tear]] ([[Dozekar the Cursed]]), bring them back to me with a [[Black Symbol]] ([[Krigara]]) as black as midnight and a [[Glowing Drake Orb]] (Named Drakes) of the ancient drakes.

